<description><div class='je_rdata_container je_wiki'><div class='je_rdata je_pr_required'><p>산출물: AXS OAuth2 위임·proxy·파일 전달. 목표: EzServer↔AXS E2E 연동.</p> <hr /> <h3><a name="20260615ESMNRoadmap%ED%86%B5%ED%95%A9%ED%9D%A1%EC%88%98"></a>2026-06-15 ESMN Roadmap 통합 흡수</h3> <ul> <li>AXS 역방향(AXS→EzServer)은 Webhook Receiver(<a href="https://vts.vatech.com/browse/ESIP-22" title="[개발] Webhook Receiver — 외부 이벤트 단일 수신&#xB7;검증&#xB7;분배 (WH, 클라우드 push)" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="ESIP-22">ESIP-22</a>) + Edge MQTT(<a href="https://vts.vatech.com/browse/ESIP-23" title="[개발] Webhook Edge 분배 — EzServer MQTT(QoS1) 역방향 채널 (WH-06)" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="ESIP-23">ESIP-23</a>) 경유로 성립.</li> <li>b1 pilot 범위는 forward(EZ→AXS) 우선, 역방향 활성화는 5단계/상세설계에서 확정.</li> </ul> </div><div class='je_sep' style='display:none'>&nbsp;&zwnj;</div><div class='je_cdata_js je_cgt' style='display:none'><!----></div><div class='je_cdata_styles je_cgt' style='display:none'><!----></div><div class='je_pr_rrj je_cgt' style='display:none'><!--[{"from":"<base href=","to":"<a href="},{"from":"white-space: nowrap;","to":""}]--></div><div class='je_pr_ssj je_cgt' style='display:none'><!--{"sf":true,"dir_auto":true,"rs":true}--></div><div class='je_pr_atj je_cgt' style='display:none'><!--[]--></div><span class='jeditor_renderer' renderer='wiki' key='ESIP-12' name='bb551445a8ffff501330ad3ca22b0149' style='display:none'></span></div></description>
